# 🔍 Agentic Research Assistant

An AI-powered multi-agent research assistant built using **LangChain**, **Groq**, **Pydantic**, and **Streamlit**.

The application automatically plans research, investigates multiple subtopics using sequential AI calls, synthesizes the findings, and produces a structured research report complete with confidence scores.

---

## Features

- 🤖 Planner Agent
- 🔍 Sequential Research Agent
- 🧠 Synthesis Agent
- 📄 Professional Research Report
- 📊 Confidence Scores
- 📈 Live Progress Tracking
- 🌐 Streamlit Web Interface
- ⚡ Powered by Groq Llama 3.3 70B
- ✅ Structured Outputs using Pydantic

---

